        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Grethen\n- Sports: middle-distance running\n- Events: 800 metres, 1500 metres, mile run, 3000 metres\n- Places: Tuntange, Luxembourg\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Grethen was born on 2 June 1992 in Tuntange.\n- Charles Grethen is a Luxembourgian middle-distance runner.\n- Charles Grethen competes primarily in the 800 metres.\n- Middle-distance running consists of track races longer than sprints and up to 3000 metres.\n- The standard middle-distance events are the 800 metres, 1500 metres, and mile run.\n- The 3000 metres may also be classified as a middle-distance event.",
